# Declare the text normalization policy for the repository: every text file
# is stored LF in git and checked out with the platform's EOL convention
# (CRLF on Windows with core.autocrlf=true). The 0.4.2 release was pushed
# with CRLF blobs committed wholesale; `git add --renormalize .` after this
# file landed converted the whole tree once, so future diffs are content-only.
* text=auto
